==Trivia==
*Issun Boushi is based on the fairy tale "[[wikipedia:Issun-bōshi|Issun-bōshi]]", in which an inch-tall samurai gets swallowed by an oni, but escapes by stabbing it in the stomach with a needle, then later marries a girl it kidnapped.

